## 🎨 6. Comprehensive Elementor AST Schemas & Widget Catalog

Every component in Elementor's `_elementor_data` array is an object with:
- `id`: 7-character hexadecimal string (`[0-9a-f]{7}`).
- `elType`: `"container"` for layout boxes; `"widget"` for content components.
- `isInner`: Boolean indicating nesting depth (`false` for top-level, `true` for inner).
- `settings`: Component properties dictionary.
- `elements`: Array of child elements.

### 6.1 Flexbox Container AST Schema (`elType: "container"`)
```json
{
  "id": "7a3b1c2",
  "elType": "container",
  "isInner": false,
  "settings": {
    "_element_id": "hero-section",
    "_css_classes": "c-hero",
    "content_width": "boxed",
    "container_type": "flex",
    "flex_direction": "column",
    "flex_direction_tablet": "column",
    "flex_direction_mobile": "column",
    "justify_content": "center",
    "align_items": "center",
    "gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 32},
    "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "24", "bottom": "80", "left": "24", "isLinked": false},
    "background_background": "classic",
    "background_color": "#0f172a",
    "custom_css": "selector { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }"
  },
  "elements": []
}
```

### 6.2 Heading Widget Schema (`widgetType: "heading"`)
```json
{
  "id": "4d5e6f1",
  "elType": "widget",
  "widgetType": "heading",
  "settings": {
    "_element_id": "hero-headline",
    "_css_classes": "c-hero__headline",
    "title": "Autonomous Infrastructure Management",
    "header_size": "h1",
    "align": "center",
    "title_color": "#f8fafc",
    "typography_typography": "custom",
    "typography_font_family": "Inter",
    "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 56},
    "typography_font_weight": "800",
    "typography_line_height": {"unit": "em", "size": 1.15}
  },
  "elements": []
}
```

